sikhī, saṁyutta, and sāvatthī have sympathetically stilled suttas.
bhaddiya, bārāṇasī, baka brahmā, and bāhiya built big banyan.
acchariy'abbhūtadhamma piṇḍapātapārisuddhi sutta majjhima nikāya.
What bliss! What bliss! Truly, the Buddha's bidding is done.
stop, listen.
stop; listen.
stop: listen.
stop—listen.
stop… listen.
stop [listen] now.
stop • listen.
